      "content": "but it’s not temporary. that’s the thing. everyone has already moved on. i’ve seen the way people look at me in the grocery store, like i'm some kind of mistake. there’s no way to fix this. once you’re cast out like this, you’re just... gone. there's no version of the future where i'm part of the world again. it feels more real than anything else.",
